<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Creation Station — Now in Beta | Rebel Ranch Ministries</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Creation Station is in active beta. See what we're building for young creators and sign up to be one of our first testers.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/site-core.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/creation-station.css">
  <style>
    .beta-topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1.1rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem); }
    .beta-topbar .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .beta-topbar .brand img { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
    .beta-topbar .brand strong { color: #fff; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .beta-topbar a.home-link { color: #e7dcf0; font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
    .beta-hero { padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 10%, rgba(236,78,145,.28), transparent 24%),
      linear-gradient(#1d0637 0%, #2d0e54 58%, #a64b93 86%, #f3d6ca 97%, #fbf7ef 100%); }
    .beta-badge { display: inline-block; padding: .35rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); color: #ffe2ef; font-weight: 800; font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .beta-hero h1 { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.03; margin: 0 0 1rem; max-width: 34rem; }
    .beta-hero p.lead { color: #f3e9fb; font-size: 1.08rem; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 0 1.75rem; }
    .beta-section { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem) 0; }
    .beta-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
    .beta-feature { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: .3rem solid var(--pink); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.4rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
    .beta-feature:nth-child(2) { border-top-color: var(--teal); }
    .beta-feature:nth-child(3) { border-top-color: var(--gold); }
    .beta-feature:nth-child(4) { border-top-color: var(--purple); }
    .beta-feature h3 { margin: 0 0 .4rem; color: var(--purple-900); font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .beta-feature p { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: .92rem; }
    .beta-cta { background: var(--purple-950); border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); text-align: center; color: #fff; }
    .beta-cta h2 { margin: 0 0 .75rem; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem); }
    .beta-cta p { color: #e7dcf0; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; }
    .beta-footer { padding: 2rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem) 3rem; text-align: center; color: var(--text); font-size: .85rem; }
    .beta-footer a { color: var(--purple); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="beta-hero">
      <div class="beta-topbar wrap">
        <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Rebel Ranch Ministries home">
          <img src="assets/creation-station-logo.png" alt="Creation Station logo">
          <strong>Creation Station</strong>
        </a>
        <a class="home-link" href="index.html">Rebel Ranch Ministries</a>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="beta-badge">Now in beta</span>
        <h1>We're building somewhere real for kids to create, learn, and grow.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Creation Station is a working dashboard — guided projects, a private portfolio, weekly live creative sessions, and a real path toward a young creator's own storefront. We're testing it with real families right now before opening it up wide, and we'd love your family to be one of the first.</p>
        <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:rebelranchfl@gmail.com?subject=Creation%20Station%20Beta%20Tester">Sign up to be a beta tester</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="beta-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading centered">
          <p class="section-kicker">What's already working</p>
          <h2>A real dashboard, not a mockup.</h2>
          <p>Here's what a family actually gets inside Creation Station today.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="beta-grid">
          <article class="beta-feature">
            <h3>Guided Projects</h3>
            <p>A step-by-step creative journey — Dream It, Plan It, Make It, Capture It, Share It, Grow It — that tracks real progress instead of a number a kid just makes up.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="beta-feature">
            <h3>Private Portfolio</h3>
            <p>A working record of finished projects, kept private by default and under parent or guardian control the whole way.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="beta-feature">
            <h3>Weekly Live Sessions</h3>
            <p>A live creative gathering where kids can make things together, guided or on their own project, with kids who get it.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="beta-feature">
            <h3>Growing Toward a Real Storefront</h3>
            <p>Practice building pricing, products, and a story for free — with a real, shareable page as the next step when a family's ready.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="beta-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="beta-cta">
          <h2>Want an early look?</h2>
          <p>We're inviting a small number of families in first, listening closely, and improving fast. If that sounds like your family, tell us a bit about your creator and we'll get you set up.</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:rebelranchfl@gmail.com?subject=Creation%20Station%20Beta%20Tester">Sign up to be a beta tester</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="beta-footer wrap">
    <p>Creation Station is a program of <a href="index.html">Rebel Ranch Ministries</a>. No sales, income, or outcomes are guaranteed — Creation Station provides tools and opportunity, not promises.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
